            "content": "<p><strong>Breescape. Built to sleep through.</strong></p><p>Powered by patented BlendTek™ technology, our bedding is made from a carefully balanced mix of fibers engineered for breathability and moisture-wicking comfort, helping you enjoy a cooler, more refreshing sleep.</p><p><strong>BlendTek™ Fabric:</strong> 69% Nylon, 20% Polyester, 11% Spandex</p><p></p><p><strong>Next-Level Cooling, Uninterrupted Comfort</strong></p><p>Our upgraded cooling comforter combines <strong>BlendTek™ technology </strong>with cooling fibers for dynamic temperature regulation, keeping you comfortably cool as your body temperature shifts. The Silk & Down-Like filling ensures lightweight, breathable loft, delivering soft, airy comfort and all-night airflow.</p><p>Featuring a dual-sided design with thoughtfully paired colors, it lets you choose the side that fits your sleep mood or room style, bringing premium comfort and style together in one comforter.</p>",
